test_options -- del_vor's keyword options (Nov 2026)
=======================================================================

QUICK START

  sh run_options_tests.sh [path-to-del_vor]    26 runs, about 1 s
  open summary.html

WHAT IS TESTED

  The keyword / value options, given in any order:

    stor, uge, tough2 FILE    outputs (several in one run)
    zero_area remove|keep     default remove
    zero_tol X                default 1e-12 (|A| <= X d^2 for tets,
                              X d for triangles)
    compress on|off           default on
    cv voronoi

  lanl/voronoi's -type, -o and bare -compress, and commands that must
  be refused. One case per line of cases.txt, run in work/NAME on the
  lanl/voronoi meshes (../test_voronoi_gold/inputs).

WHAT IS CHECKED (check_options.py)

  every case    the expected exit status; exactly the expected files
                written, nothing else
  refused       exit 1, a message naming the bad token, no output
  zero_area     the pairs left out are exactly those with |A| <=
                zero_tol d^2 in the zero_area keep run, for zero_tol
                1e-12 (default) and 0.05; zero_tol 0 leaves out only
                zero-area pairs; zero_area keep has every mesh edge;
                volumes never change
  compress      on and off hold the same matrix (1e-14), on writes
                fewer values
  order         the same options in another order write the same file
  outputs       .stor, .uge and MESH from one run list the same
                connections

PICTURE (logs/)

  zero_area.svg   the unit cube (5 tets) with zero_area keep (18
                  connections; the 6 face diagonals have zero area)
                  and remove (12)

FILES

  run_options_tests.sh   runner (work/, logs/)
  cases.txt              the cases: name | exit | arguments
  check_options.py       checks, picture, summary.html
